  "text": "Every guy wants to achieve this old money look with their appearance, but nobody tells you how. That is until now, because this is what my hair looks like every morning, and I make it look like this with two simple products. They are from The Merman. It's their curling cream and sea salt spray. These two products are made without alcohol, which means it's not gonna dry out your hair. It's also not gonna leave your hair greasy. I don't have time for a ten-step hair routine, and I know you don't either. That's why I choose The Merman. You wake up, put some of this in, and I'm telling you, it is straight confidence in a bottle. If you struggle with flat, dry hair, especially after shampoo day, this is going to solve this problem for you immediately. If you want that old money look every single day like me, I'm gonna leave a link on this video if you wanna pick some up. They do sell quick, so grab 'em while you can.",
